Package: densmix
Type: Package
Title: Fit Density Mixture Models Using EM
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = "Aleksandrs",
      family = "Gehsbargs",
      email = "your-email@example.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Fits density mixtures using the expectation-maximization algorithm. It also
    provides functions for data simulation and visualization of fitted models. Two mixture 
    models are supported (a) one-dimensional mixtures of exponential and normal
    distributions and (b) mixtures of multinomials
